ype": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information about  food, eating and meals in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Tipping Etiquette"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "If you are happy with the service at a restaurant, hotel or bar, you tip the person who served you.<br><br/> A tip is an amount of money that you give after you have paid the bill. In North America, it is common to tip a waiter or waitress 15 - 20% for good service.<br><br>If you pay cash, you use an expression like<span class=\"italic\"> \"Keep the change\"</span>  if you want to give a tip and do not need any money back after paying your bill."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Bill</span>: Could I get the bill, please?<br><span class=\"strong\">Waiter</span>: Certainly. Here it is. It's $8.50.<br><span class=\"strong\">Bill</span>: Thank you. Here's $10. You can keep the change!"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "tip"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an amount of money you give for good service"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We should tip 20%. The waiter was very nice."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob07aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you are ready to leave the restaurant."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "bill"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the amount you have to pay for a meal "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Here comes the bill. Let me pay it!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob07aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to get the tip/bill"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to pay the tip or the bill "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Thank you for getting the bill. I'll get the tip!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob07aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "service "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the work of a waiter or waitress "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I really like this restaurant. The service is excellent."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob07aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "waiter"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a man who works in a restaurant or bar "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Adam is a good waiter. He works really hard."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob07aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "waitress "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a woman who works in a restaurant or bar "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Anna is a good waitress. She works really hard."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob07aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "Do you take credit? "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "Can I pay with a credit card?"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'd like to get the bill. Do you take credit?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob07aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to split"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to divide the bill in an equal amount between two or more people "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The bill is expensive. Shall we split it?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob07aud08"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn3le08ob07re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Modal Verbs for Requests"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the modal verbs <span class=\"italic\">can</span> and <span class=\"italic\">could</span> to make polite requests in a restaurant. "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Modal Verb</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Polite Request</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"can\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Can we split the bill, please?</span><br/><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Can you pass me that?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"could\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Excuse me, could we have the bill, please?</span><br/><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Could I pay with credit?</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Go online. Research the etiquette for tipping in two countries."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Compare the custom with your country. How is it the same or different?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write the information in the chart below. Look at the example."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write 2 sentences for each country."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Country\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Do people usually tip? \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"How much?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Japan</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">No</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">0%</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Your country</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I research customs in other countries online."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write about tipping etiquette."}]}]}